#. event 233, page 1 | screen 128, cell (2,2)
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "IVENT01/e233/p1/t22"
msgid "青木　：・・・確かに・・学長や若月さんと　　　　くらべれば、俺達はパワーで勝って　　　　もコントロールができないから　　　　　　なんの意味もないコトになる・・。"
msgstr "Aoki: ...True.. compared to the Principal and Wakatsuki, even if we beat them on power, we can't control it, so it would be meaningless.."

#. event 233, page 1 | screen 128, cell (2,2)
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "IVENT01/e233/p1/t23"
msgid "美広　：もし、仮に私達が誰かに向かって　　　　　九字を切れば、その人は死ぬかも　　　　　しれないとか・・・"
msgstr "Bihiro: Like, if we were to cut the Kuji at somebody, that person might die..."

#. event 233, page 1 | screen 128, cell (2,2)
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "IVENT01/e233/p1/t24"
msgid "青木　：ココにいるのは、俺と美広と学長、　　　　若月さんに・・・・千歳、伊達　　　　　　ぐらいだ。　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　人間なんか、もういないだろう。"
msgstr "Aoki: The only ones here are me, you, the Principal, Wakatsuki.... and Chitose and Date. There can't be any other humans left."

#. event 233, page 1 | screen 128, cell (2,2)
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "IVENT01/e233/p1/t25"
msgid "美広　：・・・伊達ちゃん・・・"
msgstr "Bihiro: ...Date..."

#. event 233, page 2 | screen 128, cell (3,1)
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "IVENT01/e233/p2/t00"
msgid "美広　：・・・寒くない？"
msgstr "Bihiro: ...Isn't it cold?"

#. event 233, page 3 | screen 128, cell (2,1)
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "IVENT01/e233/p3/t00"
msgid "美広　：なんか、すごくイヤな予感がする。　　　　胸がドキドキして・・・緊張してる　　　　みたい。"
msgstr "Bihiro: I have a really bad feeling. My heart is pounding... I think I'm nervous."

#. event 233, page 3 | screen 128, cell (2,1)
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "IVENT01/e233/p3/t01"
msgid "青木　：若月さんも学長も俺達よりずっと　　　　　”そういう力”があるんだからさぁ　　　　二人でドカーンと除霊とかすれば　　　　　いいのに・・・。"
msgstr "Aoki: Wakatsuki and the Principal have way more of \"that kind of power\" than us. The two of them should just exorcise everything with a big bang..."

#. event 233, page 3 | screen 128, cell (2,1)
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "IVENT01/e233/p3/t02"
msgid "美広　：そうだよねぇ。二人でドカーンと"
msgstr "Bihiro: I know, right? The two of them, with a big bang"

#. event 233, page 3 | screen 128, cell (2,1)
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "IVENT01/e233/p3/t03"
msgid "美広　：そうだよねぇ。二人でドカーンと　　　　　・・・・・きゃー！"
msgstr "Bihiro: I know, right? The two of them, with a big bang.....Eeek!"

#. event 233, page 3 | screen 128, cell (2,1)
#, fuzzy
